# OntoBricks — human/test mirror of `databricks.yml` `sync.exclude`.
#
# Databricks Asset Bundles do **not** read this file. Deployed files are:
#   git-tracked − .gitignore + sync.include − sync.exclude
# Keep this list aligned with `databricks.yml` so Help Center tests and
# reviewers have one readable checklist. Edit both together.
#
# Runtime payload (must ship):
#   src/          — application code, including mcp-server/ and jobs/
#   docs/*.md     — Help Center catalog (see src/api/routers/internal/help.py)
#   docs/images/  — Help Center diagrams
#   docs/screenshots/
#   app.yaml / run.py / pyproject.toml / uv.lock / requirements.txt
#   LICENSE.txt / NOTICE.txt

